# Rizcard standard corner HUD (layout 1 locked)

Layout `00001` is the **reference** finish. Layouts `00002`–`00004` mirror the same metrics via `_stamp_standard_corner_hud` + `_STANDARD_CORNER_HUD` corner pairs. Prefer the named `_HUD_*` constants in `bot/ui/b40_image.py` over magic numbers.

## Pattern

- **Art**: normal colour illustration behind chrome (transparent frame preferred). Layout **37** filter / specials only when the user asks.
- **Bio (1–4)**: text **centered** in the chrome bio pillar — no generated pill.
- **Layouts 8–10 + 30** (`_NOTCH_SPLIT_HUD`): avatar **TL**, name **TR**, bio **BR** accent pill. Tuned; treat as locked unless asked.
- **Layouts 5–7**: mirror — avatar **BR**, name **BL**, bio **TL**. Tuned; treat as locked unless asked.
- **Layouts 11 + 20** (`_BAND_CENTER_HUD`): avatar on **top** banner seam (centered); name above **bottom** bio pill. Art-window silhouette fixed for open frames.
- **Layouts 12 + 29**: vertical flip — bio in **top** pill, name below it; avatar on **bottom** banner seam.
- **Layouts 13–15** (`_FOOTER_STACK_HUD`): BL avatar + name in wide footer bar + bio pill under the bar (same format, different accent colors).
- **Layout 16**: same slots as **02** (avatar BL, name above the BR bio pill). Nudges: `_L16_AVATAR_X/Y_NUDGE`, `_L16_NAME_X/Y_NUDGE`.
- **Layout 17**: same sizes and TR avatar as **03**, but the name sits **under** the bio pill. Nudges: `_L17_*`.
- **Layout 18**: same footer metrics as **14**, name raised (`_L18_NAME_Y_NUDGE`, negative = higher). Plate is forced opaque.
- **Layout 19**: layout 18 mirrored and moved to the top. Nudges: `_L19_*`. Plate is forced opaque.
- `+X` on those nudges moves right, `+Y` moves down. They do not move the reference layout.
- **Layouts 1–20 are temporarily locked.** Do not retune them while working on 21–28.
- **Layouts 21–28** (`_WAVE_HUD`): colored banner. The avatar uses the circle already authored on that layout. 21–24 keep the bio in a far pill. 25–26 stack the name above the bio on the banner. 27–28 stack the bio above the name. Nudges live in `_WAVE_NUDGE` (`avatar`, `name`, `bio`; +X right, +Y down). Layouts 1–20 stay locked.
- **Name**: white fill + thin layout-accent stroke; slight letter tracking; **always above** the bio pillar (including bottom-corner layouts 00002/00004); right-side names align near the pillar’s **true** rounded-cap right (expand pillar bbox beyond top/bottom arcs).
- **Avatar**: circular portrait in the opposite corner from name+bio; tighter Y gap than X gap.

